## Visual Apps — image-first layouts

Use for **portfolio, gallery, catalog, and creative showcase** apps where images are the primary content. Still follow VTC structure tokens (`surface-*`, dual theme, runtime accent, standard container). Reference: `portfolio` app.

### When to use

| App type | Public entry | Admin |
|----------|--------------|-------|
| CRM, inventory, bookings | List/task screen + sticky header | Floating-label forms |
| **Visual / portfolio** | **Grid/masonry immediately** — minimal chrome | Simplified `.input` + upload fields OK |

### Public page — minimal chrome

- **No sticky header** on the public browse view unless the brief requires branding nav.
- **No hero banner** by default — let work fill the viewport.
- Start with **toolbar row**: category filters (left) + layout switcher and optional admin gear icon (right).
- Use container: `max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-6 pb-16` (visual/grid tier).

```tsx
<div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-6">
  <CategoryPills … />
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0 self-end sm:self-auto">
    {isAdmin && <AdminGearLink />}
    <LayoutSwitcher … />
  </div>
</div>
```

### Category filter pills

Active = filled accent (`bg-app-accent`); inactive = soft gray/surface. Use `rounded-full`, not `rounded-xl`.

```tsx
<button
  className={`px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-colors ${
    active
      ? 'bg-app-accent text-white shadow-md'
      : 'bg-gray-100 dark:bg-surface-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-surface-200 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-surface-600'
  }`}
/>
```

### Layout switcher (segmented control)

Masonry · Grid · List — one bordered group, active segment `bg-app-accent text-white`.

```tsx
<div className="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700 overflow-hidden shadow-sm" role="group">
  {/* segments */}
</div>
```

### Masonry grid (`globals.css`)

```css
.masonry-grid { column-gap: 1rem; }
.masonry-item { break-inside: avoid; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
```

```tsx
<div className="masonry-grid columns-1 sm:columns-2 lg:columns-3">
  {/* items */}
</div>
```

Uniform grid: `grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4` with `aspect-[4/3]` image frames.  
List/case-study: horizontal row — thumbnail + title + description.

### Image card (card-as-button)

Cards are **buttons** or links — not nested cards. Image hover only; keep copy minimal.

```tsx
<button className="masonry-item w-full text-left group rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-surface-800 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700">
  <img className="w-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300" loading="lazy" />
  <div className="p-4">
    <h4 className="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Title</h4>
    <p className="mt-1 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2">…</p>
  </div>
</button>
```

- Featured label (short status only): `text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-app-accent-text`
- Prefer `rounded-2xl` on visual cards (slightly softer than admin `rounded-xl`)

### Lightbox

Full-screen `bg-black/90`, keyboard ←/→/Esc, image `max-h-[75vh] object-contain`. No likes, comments, or social chrome.

### Admin gear (signed-in only)

On visual-app **public browse** toolbars only: admin entry may use **slot 3** (`Settings` icon) when the brief requires visible admin access. Otherwise admin lives in the **slot 4 ellipsis menu**. Links to `/admin` with `addTokenToUrl`; `aria-label` from i18n.

### Admin forms — simplified inputs

Visual-app **admin CRUD** may use a shared `.input` utility instead of floating labels when forms are long or upload-heavy:

```css
.input {
  @apply w-full px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-surface-300 dark:border-surface-600
    bg-white dark:bg-surface-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white shadow-sm
    focus:ring-2 focus:ring-app-accent focus:border-app-accent outline-none;
}
```

Use **floating labels** on short public-facing forms; **`.input` + label above** on admin item/settings screens.

### Image upload field

Pattern: **preview → upload button → URL fallback** (never `alert()` / `confirm()`).

```tsx
{/* Preview with remove */}
{/* Primary: Upload image — POST multipart to /api/upload/image */}
{/* Secondary: text input for pasted URL */}
```

- Cover: single `ImageUploadField`
- Gallery: multi-upload grid + textarea for URL list
- Profile/logo: same as cover, `folder="profile"`

### Visual app checklist

- [ ] Public home = browse grid (not dashboard, not hero)
- [ ] Category pills + layout modes (masonry / grid / list)
- [ ] Lightbox for item detail / gallery
- [ ] Dual theme on cards, toolbar, lightbox, admin
- [ ] Admin gear visible only when JWT present
- [ ] i18n for all labels including `aria-label` on icon controls
- [ ] Lazy-load images (`loading="lazy"`)
- [ ] No nested cards; borders + spacing separate admin sections

